+# CONTRACT — T7 Plugin Marketplace
+
+## Registry (`src/registry`)
+- [ ] register() stores a manifest by name+version → getVersion returns it
+- [ ] A plugin can have multiple versions → listVersions returns all, sorted
+- [ ] get(name) returns the latest version manifest, null if unknown
+- [ ] list() returns every manifest across all names/versions
+- [ ] search(query) matches name/description/author (case-insensitive)
+- [ ] remove(name, version) deletes one version, returns false if absent
+- [ ] update(name, version, updates) merges fields, keeps name/version
+
+## Resolver (`src/resolver`)
+- [ ] satisfies(version, range) delegates to semver
+- [ ] maxSatisfying(versions, range) returns best match or null
+- [ ] validRange(range) true for valid, false for garbage
+- [ ] resolve(constraints, available) returns ResolvedVersion[] for satisfiable constraints
+
+## Runner (`src/runner`)
+- [ ] execute(code) runs code in vm and returns output + success
+- [ ] context variables are accessible inside the sandbox
+- [ ] thrown errors → success:false with error message
+- [ ] executeWithTimeout aborts runaway (infinite) sync loops
+- [ ] result includes duration and memoryUsed numbers
+
+## Reviews (`src/reviews`) — better-sqlite3
+- [ ] addReview persists & returns Review with id, createdAt, flagged:false
+- [ ] getReviews(plugin) / getReviewsByUser(user) query correctly
+- [ ] getAverageRating excludes flagged reviews; 0 when none
+- [ ] flagReview marks flagged; getFlaggedReviews returns them
+- [ ] removeReview / getReviewCount work
+
+## Deps (`src/deps`)
+- [ ] buildTree returns nested DependencyNode tree
+- [ ] detectCycles returns cycle paths or null
+- [ ] hasCircularDependency boolean
+- [ ] topologicalSort returns dependencies-before-dependents order
+- [ ] flattenDependencies returns unique transitive dep names
+
+## Integration (`src/index.ts`)
+- [ ] createMarketplace composes all 5 services
+- [ ] installPlugin validates required fields (name/version/entryPoint)
+- [ ] installPlugin registers, resolves deps, rejects circular, runs entry point
+- [ ] returns resolved versions + sandbox result
+
+## Build
+- [ ] npm run build / lint / test all pass
